OL,3,GNEWSABumpy estate road to be completed
OL,4,Afive years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA piece of unfinished road that
OL,7,Fresidents have described as "a
OL,8,Fnightmare" will finally be completed
OL,9,Fafter more than five years, a
OL,10,Fcouncillor has said.
OL,12,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,13,Fsaid a "severe bump" was left at the
OL,14,Fentrance to the new estate on Allen
OL,15,FRoad in Waddington, Lincolnshire, after
OL,16,Fthe original contractors used by
OL,17,Fdevelopers Jelson went out of business.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
