OL,3,GNEWSABumpy estate road to be completed
OL,4,Afive years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Tom Dyer said the company
OL,7,Fhad committed to finding a new
OL,8,Fcontractor and the work would
OL,9,F"hopefully" be completed by the end of
OL,10,Fthe year.
OL,12,FThe company said: "Jelson Ltd are aware
OL,13,Fof the remedial work required to the
OL,14,Festate road off Grantham Road. We
OL,15,Fremain committed to completing these
OL,16,Fworks as quickly as possible."
